      "message": "According to the merge graph (https://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/automerger/graph/project/android/platform/hardware/interfaces), `AUTOMERGE RESTRICT` is honored between android13-test-dev and master branches.\n\nAnd, I don\u0027t think the last line will prevent this change from being merged into master branch.  For between branches `AUTOMERGE RESTRICT` is not honored, we are required to put `Merged-In` to avoid automerge conflicts.",
